	(text "FE1.1S configuration (datasheet Rev. B12.6E, pin table pp. 8-10):\n- BUSJ = 3.3V: report SELF-POWERED, so the host does not cap cameras at 100 mA\n- VBUSM = 3.3V: hub is powered only from host VBUS, so 'host present' is implicit\n- OVCJ = 3.3V: no over-current sensing; PWRJ (port power switch) unused\n- DRV pulled low at reset: normal hub (charging mode off); LED1/LED2 unused\n- TESTJ open (internal pull-up); XRSTJ pulled up, internal power-on reset\n- XIN/XOUT: internal load caps and feedback resistor, crystal 12 MHz 20 pF\n- REXT: 2.7k 1% to VSS; port 4 unused"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cd757cd3-b0ad-4a19-b103-daca4ee877ae")
	)
	(text "Port map: 1 = CAM1 (J2), 2 = IMU (J1), 3 = CAM2 (J3), 4 unused.\nCamera/IMU pin order: 1 VBUS, 2 D-, 3 D+, 4 GND (J1 matches hub_imu J1).\nU2/U3 USBLC6-2SC6: ESD at the camera connectors; route D-/D+ through pins 1-6 / 3-4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.1 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "50fef14f-7d4e-4bf3-b731-e510cd9f3b3b")
	)
